From 969a3fb93030e6492b3afbfa41f4d1d3db95d59e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: "Claude (for konata09)" <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sun, 25 Oct 2026 12:58:48 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 4/9] net: hisilicon: higmac-ascend: port vendor driver to
 v6.18

Drop the Ascend SDK dependencies (drv_log, securec, profiling sampler,
fault manager, EEPROM char device) and the diagnostic RGMII MBIST, take
the PHY from phy-handle (MDIO is served by the in-tree hns_mdio), map
the shared system controller without claiming it, and follow the API
changes since v4.19 (NAPI, tx_timeout, eth_ioctl, skb frags, timers,
link modes, platform remove).
